From: PS5_Proton <local>
Subject: [PATCH] Compose stable HWND surfaces in Wine's authoritative scene order

Keep independent pixels from all processes; the server snapshot owns stacking,
visibility, geometry and lifetime. Reject stale/malformed/capacity-limited pages
with a typed adoption ACK. Retain stable images across static focus changes and
release mappings after window destruction or native owner exit. Globally opt-in
until GPU-to-HWND association and transparent/region surfaces are qualified.

Base: PS5_Vulkan 87a48676dda0977d5ba8ff1ddcf02816d41c443b
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

